      "start_raw": "01:05.30",
      "end_raw": "01:12.80",
      "start_ms": 65300,
      "end_ms": 72800,
      "text": "\"A maid with herbs in her possession, a secret medicine, an unauthorized visit to the Duchess's chamber.\"",
